      "fontSize": 15,
      "fontFamily": 5,
      "text": "MODEL-CALL LEDGER — FOR N SESSIONS\n\nContexto: floor(N / B)   · every complete B\nShino:       floor(N / C)   · every complete C\nReader:      1                   · once per question\nAnswer:      1                   · once per question\n\nTOTAL AGENT LLM CALLS = floor(N/B) + floor(N/C) + 2\nExternal canonical judge = 1 separate LLM call",
      "rawText": "MODEL-CALL LEDGER — FOR N SESSIONS\n\nContexto: floor(N / B)   · every complete B\nShino:       floor(N / C)   · every complete C\nReader:      1                   · once per question\nAnswer:      1                   · once per question\n\nTOTAL AGENT LLM CALLS = floor(N/B) + floor(N/C) + 2\nExternal canonical judge = 1 separate LLM call",
      "textAlign": "center",
      "verticalAlign": "middle",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "MODEL-CALL LEDGER — FOR N SESSIONS\n\nContexto: floor(N / B)   · every complete B\nShino:       floor(N / C)   · every complete C\nReader:      1                   · once per question\nAnswer:      1                   · once per question\n\nTOTAL AGENT LLM CALLS = floor(N/B) + floor(N/C) + 2\nExternal canonical judge = 1 separate LLM call",
      "autoResize": false,
      "lineHeight": 1.28
    },
